OL,3,GNEWSASt Albans homes shut after
OL,4,Acomplaints of cuckooing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree homes in and around St Albans
OL,7,Fhave been closed following complaints
OL,8,Fof drug dealing, cuckooing and other
OL,9,Fillegal activity.
OL,11,FSt Albans City and District Council
OL,12,Fsecured the closure orders which
OL,13,Fprevent anybody from entering the
OL,14,Fproperties without formal permission.
OL,16,FThe council's anti-social behaviour
OL,17,Fteam took action after complaints about
OL,18,Fa property in Bardwell Court and two
OL,19,Fflats in Cottonmill Lane and
OL,20,FSpringfield Road.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
